<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank not to hold tender for repos on Thur.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank not to hold tender for repos on Thur.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said in a statment it would not hold a tender for short-term securities repurchase on Thursday.</p>
<p>The statement gave no further details.</p>
<p>According to official NBS figures, the banking sector is short of liquidity, with banks' minimum reserve demands fulfilled at 98.07 percent as of Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
